       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CUSTRSK.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       COPY RISKSCR.

       LINKAGE SECTION.
       COPY AUTHREQ.
       COPY LIMITCTX.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING AUTH-REQUEST LIMIT-CONTEXT.
           INITIALIZE RISK-MESSAGE
           MOVE AR-ACCOUNT-ID TO RM-ACCOUNT-ID

           CALL 'MQRSKGET' USING RISK-MESSAGE

           IF RM-OK
              MOVE 'Y' TO LC-RISK-AVAILABLE
              MOVE RM-RISK-SCORE TO LC-RISK-SCORE
           ELSE
              MOVE 'N' TO LC-RISK-AVAILABLE
              MOVE 000 TO LC-RISK-SCORE
           END-IF
           GOBACK.
